WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.303
Today we will select colours intentionally. Our work connects with Ghanaian and other

00:00:05.303 --> 00:00:06.088
African artists.

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:09.745
Choose three colours that suit your chosen message.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:16.187
Test the colours in small labelled boxes. Record why your chosen technique suits the

00:00:16.187 --> 00:00:16.561
message.

00:00:17.367 --> 00:00:20.972
Circle the most readable combination and plan where to use it.
